s/comments/318947440","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/issues/10948#issuecomment-318947440","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/10948","id":318947440,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDMxODk0NzQ0MA==","user":{"login":"markstory","id":24086,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MDg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24086?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory","html_url":"https://github.com/markstory","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-07-31T01:46:00Z","updated_at":"2017-07-31T01:46:00Z","body":"I took a look at this and because of the dashed route, the resulting controller parameter is `Underscore_tests` which is why the controller cannot be found. The MissingController error page, then uses Inflection to generate class & file names which is the source confusing error.\r\n\r\nWould it be reasonable to generate a different error page content if the `controller` parameter contains an `_`? Instead of pointing to the file/class that is missing it can recommend checking your routes?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/318947440/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"markstory","id":24086,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MDg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24086?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory","html_url":"https://github.com/markstory","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/319110997","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/issues/10948#issuecomment-319110997","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/10948","id":319110997,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDMxOTExMDk5Nw==","user":{"login":"GusAntoniassi","id":4432387,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzIzODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4432387?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GusAntoniassi","html_url":"https://github.com/GusAntoniassi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GusAntoniassi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GusAntoniassi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GusAntoniassi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GusAntoniassi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GusAntoniassi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GusAntoniassi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GusAntoniassi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GusAntoniassi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GusAntoniassi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-07-31T15:48:40Z","updated_at":"2017-07-31T15:48:40Z","body":"Yes, that would be quite good. I would suggest to hint that the default skeleton route now uses dashes instead of underscores (something like \"Did you mean: [underscore-tests](#)\"); that'd be an useful tip for those coming from 2.x like me.\r\nAlso it could be worth adding a `Changed in version 3.x` in the [bake documentation page](https://book.cakephp.org/3.0/en/bake/usage.html) or the [migration guide](https://book.cakephp.org/3.0/en/appendices/3-0-migration-guide.html), since the default route was underscored in CakePHP 2.x, and those were the two pages I consulted when I found this error.\r\nThat information is however noted on the [CakePHP conventions page](https://book.cakephp.org/3.0/en/intro/conventions.html#url-considerations-for-controller-names), which I didn't think of looking into (shame on me).\r\n\r\nBest regards.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/319110997/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"GusAntoniassi","id":4432387,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzIzODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4432387?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GusAntoniassi","html_url":"https://github.com/GusAntoniassi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GusAntoniassi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GusAntoniassi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GusAntoniassi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.gi